{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story</strong><br><br>As a rookie architect at <i>Anping Construction</i>, you step into the thunderous chaos of the worksite. But concrete and blueprints aren't your only battles\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830500/extras/eaf6ef531baad461eb6ba5bb23c6c7a0.avif?t=1754388894\" width=800 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25b8 <strong>Dawn Gu</strong> (Heiress Supervisor): Forces you to call her &quot;<i>little sister</i>&quot; while posing as a newbie, hiding childhood scars beneath her armor.<br>\u25b8 <strong>Jade Ling</strong> (Ice Queen Boss): Marks your drafting errors in red ink, weaving &quot;<i>big sister</i>&quot; into a sweet prison.<br>\u25b8 <strong>Grace Su</strong> (Financial Auditor): Your college crush resurfaces, burying unspoken love in audit reports.<br>\u25b8 <strong>Sunny Lin</strong> (Homemaker Cousin): Shoves healing bento boxes into your hands, clinging to &quot;<i>sibling normalcy</i>&quot; like a lifeline.<br>\u26a0\ufe0f <strong>WARNING</strong>: When the crane collapses, <strong>four screams will shatter every lie</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830500/extras/42b70e3bfa58845a3db17ee373064257.avif?t=1754388894\" width=1538 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot-Style Site Management</strong><br>\u25b8 Pull the lever for &quot;<i>Construction Day Roulette</i>&quot;: React to <strong>60+ symbols</strong> to fund your romance! <br>\u25b8 <strong>Combine heroine skills</strong> (Unlock post-story):<br>\u3000\u30fbSunny's Bento: Restore stamina \u2665<br>\u3000\u30fbDawn's Directive: Double rewards \ud83d\udcb0<br>\u3000\u30fbGrace's Ledger: Draw extra cards \ud83c\udccf<br>\u3000\u30fbJade's Red Pen: Delete junk symbols \u2702</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Leaderboards</strong><br>Prove you're the chosen civil engineer! Battle global players in luck-vs-strategy showdowns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Ambition</strong><br>\u25b8 <strong>7 divergent endings</strong> \u2014 but why choose? Unlock conditions to pursue the... <i>harem route</i>?!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u65b0\u661f\u5347\u8d77","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/54557196c383c6e868288e71132a4c4937f12948.jpg"},{"name":"\u5982\u6797\u6240\u613f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/a4bc51d012377ba4fa857781f05629aca02a79fb.jpg"},{"name":"\u5927\u5c0f\u59d0\u7ba1\u5bb6","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/83b940a48a719ae6b519c964b9de4b314a292aa5.jpg"},{"name":"\u5927\u53f7\u91d1\u7816","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/f5e12b0f86c4118ef78dc36f6527621bc1d22aee.jpg"},{"name":"\u521d\u604b\u7684\u6708\u5149","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/037a5c58479c918403cd3591d00f706fc0e55378.jpg"},{"name":"\u5e73\u51e1\u4e00\u751f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/65987785264b5e80b49ce4b4ffd0708bf201887c.jpg"},{"name":"\u63d0\u6876\u8dd1\u8def","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/1485448f1e896ec63e2b6e198e3a005062d64272.jpg"},{"name":"\u68a6\u4e4b\u7ec8\u7109","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/79147a6b100d3b7d9a6402b89bb0a97f8843b3ce.jpg"},{"name":"\u5929\u547d\u6253\u5de5\u4eba","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830500/