ane collapses, <strong>four screams will shatter every lie</strong>...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830500/extras/42b70e3bfa58845a3db17ee373064257.avif?t=1754388894\" width=1538 height=838 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slot-Style Site Management</strong><br>\u25b8 Pull the lever for &quot;<i>Construction Day Roulette</i>&quot;: React to <strong>60+ symbols</strong> to fund your romance! <br>\u25b8 <strong>Combine heroine skills</strong> (Unlock post-story):<br>\u3000\u30fbSunny's Bento: Restore stamina \u2665<br>\u3000\u30fbDawn's Directive: Double rewards \ud83d\udcb0<br>\u3000\u30fbGrace's Ledger: Draw extra cards \ud83c\udccf<br>\u3000\u30fbJade's Red Pen: Delete junk symbols \u2702</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Leaderboards</strong><br>Prove you're the chosen civil engineer! Battle global players in luck-vs-strategy showdowns!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Ambition</strong><br>\u25b8 <strong>7 divergent endings</strong> \u2014 but why choose? Unlock conditions to pursue the... <i>harem route</i>?!</p>","developers":["RealmSeekers"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830500/0c37e7fb2c3e54a5fc958d1e1f9d5a24962ecbf7/header.jpg?t=1754388894","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830500/1084165536/06378e62c58daa55101f0a89ec87680e20b61bb8/1751902260/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752278701","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3830500/1084165536/06378e62c58daa55101f0a89ec87680e20b61bb8/1751902260/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752278701","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.a